Z||000000||1FST2M6||03-05-2000||12:47 AM||||Ok every one wish BlackGT (Todd) good luck! I've just sent him down the path of Clutch-dom. He left here about an hour ago with a instructions on how to do it a twinkle in his eye, a 4puck disc, new pressure plate and hope to have a faster car. Best of luck Todd! ||||reg||1
